+The `TestRunReportDataFormat` controls the format of the machine-readable test run data file (default: JSON, written compressed as `TestRunReport.krkl` from 5.0.0; see `CompressTestRunReport`). When diagram and tracking data is available, the file includes PlantUML source and HTTP interaction traces per scenario. See [[Generated Reports › TestRunReport.json (Machine-Readable Test Run Data)|Generated-Reports#testrunreportjson-machine-readable-test-run-data]].
 
